sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as cli/jobs.ts (jobs sync)
    participant T as jobs.toml
    participant H as cli-handler.ts
    participant C as jobs-clock.ts
    participant L as launchd (~/Library/LaunchAgents)

    CLI->>T: read + parseJobsConfig
    alt invalid or missing
        CLI-->>CLI: error, exit 1 (the daemon is never asked)
    end
    opt live state dir only
        CLI->>L: register each runner=launchd job (com.hydra.job.PLATFORM.NAME, stable bun), unchanged ones untouched
        CLI->>L: unregister jobs gone or now runner=daemon, move the old runner's bun.cron entries over
        Note over CLI: a failed registration is printed, and the sync exits 1 after the rest
    end
    alt no socket / refused
        CLI-->>CLI: daemon not running, it will load this on start + job lines
    else daemon up
        CLI->>H: jobs-sync
        H->>C: requestSync()
        C->>C: before = last good config (_daemon.json)
        C->>T: read + parse, lastGoodConfig = text
        C->>C: tick now: an owed slot dispatches at once
        C-->>H: {before, after}
        H-->>CLI: reply
        CLI-->>CLI: added / changed (jobs.toml keys) / removed, then job lines with each runner
    end
